     The bbccmmbbsscc driver provides support for the Broadcom Serial Control con‐
     troller integrated on Broadcom BCM283x and BCM2711 SoCs.  The Broadcom
     Serial Controller bus is compatible with the I2C bus and can be used to
     connect standard I2C slave devices.

